# Gated UI rebuild

The workbench is being rebuilt from scratch. Follow `apps/web/REBUILD.md` (landing is **1–6**; next is account).

## Required

- One phase at a time. After shipping a phase, **stop** and wait for the user to review the live page.
- Do not start the next phase until they say it is approved.
- Do not autonomously loop (audit → fix → screenshot → next) across the whole UI.
- Do not restore the deleted dashboard/canvas/inspect chrome unless a listed phase explicitly asks for that piece.
- Wrap/API routes (`app/v1`, `app/health`, `lib/wrap.ts`) stay unless the user asks to touch them.
- Landing: impressive scroll is allowed; fake proof and product-internals dumps are not.
- Color: crimson ship accent on graphite. Not ochre. Not coral. Not ice. Dashboard has no ship color.

## After each phase

Tell them the URL, what changed, and what to look at. Then wait.
